sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Visitor / User
    participant Web as Next.js Web UI
    participant NodeAPI as Node.js API (Coordinator)
    participant Vault as Token Vault & State
    participant Catalog as Intent Catalog v2
    participant Vector as PostgreSQL (pgvector)
    participant PyGateway as Python Model Gateway
    participant Guard as Node Response Guard
    participant ActionGate as Action Gate
    participant Redis as Redis Outbox
    participant Worker as Event Worker
    participant n8n as Remote n8n Webhook

    User->>Web: Sends message: "can you help me start a company"
    Web->>NodeAPI: POST /api/chat/stream (WebSocket or HTTP)
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        note over NodeAPI,Vault: Ingress Privacy & Tokenization
        NodeAPI->>Vault: Mask incoming PII
        Vault-->>NodeAPI: [NAME_1], [EMAIL_1], [PHONE_1]
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)
        note over NodeAPI,Vector: Catalog Preflight & Evidence Assembly
        NodeAPI->>Catalog: Evaluate deterministic signals & policies
        NodeAPI->>Vector: Retrieve approved knowledge embeddings (if factual)
        Vector-->>NodeAPI: Approved public knowledge snippets
        NodeAPI->>NodeAPI: Issue scoped HMAC scopeRef token
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 245)
        note over NodeAPI,PyGateway: Inference & Read-Only Tool Execution Loop
        NodeAPI->>PyGateway: POST /internal/v2/conversation/turn (Envelope + Scoped Token)
        PyGateway->>PyGateway: LangGraph Plan turn (Category: business_goal, Next: confirm_goal)
        opt Tool Execution Needed
            PyGateway->>NodeAPI: Request tool: get_available_packages / get_persona
            NodeAPI->>NodeAPI: Authorize scope & tool allowlist
            NodeAPI-->>PyGateway: Validated Tool Result
        end
        PyGateway->>PyGateway: Persona Composer drafts Zara's response
        PyGateway-->>NodeAPI: Candidate Response { answer, citationIds, planning }
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 245)
        note over NodeAPI,Guard: Node Response Guard & Verification
        NodeAPI->>Guard: Validate candidate answer, citations, factual claims
        alt Factual Claim without Citation
            Guard->>Guard: Trigger Knowledge Repair or Offline Fallback
        else Valid Conversational / Grounded Answer
            Guard-->>NodeAPI: Approved Response Verdict
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 255, 240)
        note over NodeAPI,n8n: Action Confirmation & Asynchronous Side-Effects
        opt Action Proposal or Execution Triggered
            NodeAPI->>ActionGate: Verify stage prerequisites, consent, customer confirmation
            ActionGate->>Redis: Append event to Redis Streams (e.g. intent.action.requested.v1)
            Redis-->>Worker: Claim event execution
            Worker->>n8n: Dispatch payload (e.g. /webhook/salesforce-lead)
            n8n-->>Worker: HTTP 200 { success: true, leadId: "00QFW..." }
            Worker->>NodeAPI: Update crm_leads with leadId & remote_crm
        end
    end

    NodeAPI-->>Web: Streamed turn.completed event
    Web-->>User: Zara speaks in natural tone with single contextual follow-up
